# ──────────────────────────────────────
# .gitignore — 多商户入驻电商平台
# .NET 10 + Node.js + MAUI
# ──────────────────────────────────────

## ── .NET ──
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/artifacts/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

## ── Visual Studio ──
.vs/
*.vsp
*.vsps
*.pidb
*.svclog
*.scc
*.psess
*.vsp
*.vspx
*.sap
*.e2e
*.trace

## ── Rider / VS Code ──
.idea/
*.sln.iml
.vscode/

## ── WorkBuddy 运行数据（不提交） ──
.workbuddy/

## ── Node.js (前端项目) ──
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/
**/.turbo/
**/.nuxt/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

## ── MAUI ──
**/Platforms/Android/Resources/values/
*.apk
*.aab
*.keystore
!debug.keystore

## ── 环境与密钥 ──
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.Production.json
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
!*.pub.key
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

## ── 数据库 ──
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.ndf
*.bak

## ── 压测报告（自动生成，不入库）──
docs/reports/*.html
docs/reports/*.pdf
!docs/reports/.gitkeep

## ── OS ──
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
$RECYCLE.BIN/

## ── 临时文件 ──
*.tmp
*.temp
*.swp
*~
